158 0 obj
<</Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Three Odysseys placed on two axes A scatter chart. Horizontal axis: fidelity to Homer's plot and genre, from about zero to one hundred percent. Vertical axis: interior orientation, from externalized to maximal. Three works are plotted. Homer sits at one hundred percent fidelity with externalized interiority; Wilson's translation at one hundred percent fidelity with high interiority; Joyce at about zero percent fidelity with maximal interiority. Nolan's 2026 film is not plotted: every claim about it is second-hand, and no second-hand term may occupy a position on any measured axis, so the reports about it are held in a register later in this document. The same data follows as a table, with the film's row demoted to sentences.)
/P 157 0 R
/Pg 24 0 R
/K 7>>
endobj
